`LogException.cpp` is a small V8 API example based on the 5.8 `samples/shell.cc`
snippet linked below. This directory is not the V8 engine source or its build
dependencies. The Unity plugin's recorded engine revision is V8 7.1.0.0; see
[`v8_in_unity/BUILDING.md`](../../v8_in_unity/BUILDING.md).

Source example: https://chromium.googlesource.com/v8/v8/+/branch-heads/5.8/samples/shell.cc#374